{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101254","id":2264937250,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6HADMi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101254","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101254.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101254.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101254","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101254/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101254/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101254/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3b78ff564a1a90f9a41d18bfb0e09a9711eaddb9","number":101254,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Refactor Jolt-related project settings to only be loaded as needed","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As suggested in #101237, this refactors the `JoltProjectSettings` class to not just be a class of getters that themselves just call `GLOBAL_GET` (which in some cases also get cached as a `static` variable) but instead a class of actual values.\r\n\r\nThis is then coupled with `ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->connect(\"settings_changed\", ...);` to read the settings again whenever they're changed, ensuring that we have up-to-date values without needing to call `GLOBAL_GET` all the time.\r\n\r\nThis might perhaps provide a tiny performance boost, but mostly just cleans things up a bit and lets us get rid of the caveat in the documentation about certain settings only being read once.\r\n\r\nIt should probably be noted that `bounce_velocity_threshold` can now technically be read from the physics thread (when using `physics/3d/run_on_separate_thread`) while the main thread is writing to it, but given that it's a `float` I would assume that there are no concern about \"torn reads\" or anything like that, and having the most up-to-date value when reading it isn't really a concern in this case.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJ